[ Beeping ]

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:11.133
"I'm Every Woman"
by Whitney Houston.

00:00:11.133 --> 00:00:14.501
Okay. I'm only
like three to four women,

00:00:14.501 --> 00:00:15.734
depending on
the time of the month.

00:00:15.734 --> 00:00:17.734
So I think you should
take this one, Jay.

00:00:17.734 --> 00:00:19.167
-I got like 200 personalities.

00:00:19.167 --> 00:00:21.234
I'm sure like at least a few of
them are women in there.

00:00:21.234 --> 00:00:22.400
It's fine.
-You got this. You got this.

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:24.601
-Okay. Alright. I'll do it.
-You got this?

00:00:24.601 --> 00:00:25.767
Alright, buddy. Here we go.

00:00:25.767 --> 00:00:27.868
"I'm Every Woman"
by Whitney Houston.

00:00:27.868 --> 00:00:29.601
Whenever you're ready.

00:00:29.601 --> 00:00:33.100
♪♪

00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:35.467
-Come on.

00:00:35.467 --> 00:00:37.901
Unh. Unh.
Unh, unh, unh.

00:00:48.701 --> 00:00:52.067
♪ Oh, oh, oh ♪

00:01:01.601 --> 00:01:03.434
♪ I do it naturally ♪

00:01:03.434 --> 00:01:05.434
Oh!
[ Shouting gibberish ]

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:09.834
-My spray tan!

00:01:09.834 --> 00:01:11.567
-That's what we needed.
We needed that.

00:01:11.567 --> 00:01:12.801
-Cold? I'm sorry.
It's freezing.

00:01:12.801 --> 00:01:15.334
-It's so much more than
I thought it would be.

00:01:15.334 --> 00:01:17.968
[ Laughter ]

00:01:17.968 --> 00:01:21.901
[ Distorted shouting ]

00:01:21.901 --> 00:01:24.033
-I'm sorry, you didn't get that
one completely correct.

00:01:24.033 --> 00:01:26.467
That's 50,000 points for
Dan and Terry.

00:01:26.467 --> 00:01:28.667
-Yeah! Yes!
-Whoo!

00:01:28.667 --> 00:01:31.467
-Alright, guys, for this
final song, all four of you

00:01:31.467 --> 00:01:33.567
are going to take turns singing,
so pay attention.

00:01:33.567 --> 00:01:35.167
Your screen will switch off
line by line.

00:01:35.167 --> 00:01:37.767
When the music stops,
you have to nail the lyrics

00:01:37.767 --> 00:01:39.667
or you and your partner
will get sprayed.

00:01:39.667 --> 00:01:42.567
And this round is worth
200,000 points,

00:01:42.567 --> 00:01:44.767
so whoever wins this
wins the whole thing

00:01:44.767 --> 00:01:46.367
for their charity.

00:01:46.367 --> 00:01:49.534
Let's see what
our final song is.

00:01:49.534 --> 00:01:50.667
