00:01:50.667 --> 00:01:53.634
-"Umbrella"?

00:01:53.634 --> 00:01:55.334
Oh.

00:01:55.334 --> 00:01:57.367
-Yes!
-Alright.

00:01:57.367 --> 00:01:59.100
That's good. That's good.
-Yes!

00:01:59.100 --> 00:02:01.634
-Alright.

00:02:01.634 --> 00:02:03.701
Dan, you are gonna start us off.
-Alright.

00:02:03.701 --> 00:02:05.334
-And then you're gonna
switch off. Here we go.

00:02:05.334 --> 00:02:07.033
Whenever you're ready.
-Yeah.

00:02:07.033 --> 00:02:08.267
♪♪

00:02:08.267 --> 00:02:09.667
Oh, I love it.

00:02:14.300 --> 00:02:16.934
This is a true story.

00:02:16.934 --> 00:02:18.934
♪ Makin' my way downtown ♪

00:02:18.934 --> 00:02:22.968
♪ Walkin' around,
I don't know what time it is ♪

00:02:22.968 --> 00:02:25.100
-Nikki.

00:02:27.100 --> 00:02:28.834
