00:02:28.834 --> 00:02:30.334
♪ Just makin' my way ♪

00:02:30.334 --> 00:02:33.868
♪ Makin' my way
through the crowd ♪

00:02:33.868 --> 00:02:35.434
-Yeah! Terry.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:38.734 --> 00:02:39.968
-♪ And I need you ♪

00:02:41.367 --> 00:02:42.567
-♪ And I miss you ♪

00:02:43.934 --> 00:02:47.133
-♪ And now I wonder ♪

00:02:47.133 --> 00:02:51.934
-♪ If I could fall
into the sky ♪

00:02:51.934 --> 00:02:56.901
♪ Do you think time
would pass me by? ♪

00:02:56.901 --> 00:03:01.701
-♪ 'Cause you know I'd walk
